access.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-20\",\n    \"category\": \"workspace memory\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Novi Notes 1.1\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/novi-notes\",\n    \"description\": \"Local AI memory layer for your Mac providing persistent workspace context for AI agents.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-21\",\n    \"category\": \"workspace memory\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Google Antigravity 2.0\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/google-antigravity-2\",\n    \"description\": \"Orchestrate multi-agent workflows from a desktop app for complex AI development tasks.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-21\",\n    \"category\": \"orchestration agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"buildpipe\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/buildpipe\",\n    \"description\": \"Compose, run and automate multi-step AI developer workflows for CI/CD and deployment pipelines.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-22\",\n    \"category\": \"orchestration agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Viberia\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/viberia\",\n    \"description\": \"Command AI agents like you're playing Civilization with intuitive orchestration controls for complex workflows.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-20\",\n    \"category\": \"orchestration agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LobeHub\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/lobehub\",\n    \"description\": \"Your Chief Agent Operator for multi-agent work coordinating multiple AI coding agents simultaneously.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-18\",\n    \"category\": \"orchestration agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"CtrlOps\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/ctrlops\",\n    \"description\": \"Deploy, Debug & Manage Linux Servers with AI assistance for DevOps and infrastructure workflows.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-19\",\n    \"category\": \"orchestration agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Triggered Agents by Adaptive\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/triggered-agents\",\n    \"description\": \"AI agents that run automatically on business events for reactive workflow automation.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-18\",\n    \"category\": \"orchestration agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Slideshot\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/slideshot\",\n    \"description\": \"Product demo videos recorded by your AI agent automatically for product development workflows.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-21\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"TrustClaw by Composio\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/trustclaw\",\n    \"description\": \"Self-hosted AI agent that connects 1000+ apps on Vercel for workflow automation and integrations.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-15\",\n    \"category\": \"orchestration agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"TestSprite 3.0\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/testsprite\",\n    \"description\": \"Fleet of parallel AI agents that test your app in minutes using autonomous test generation.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-22\",\n    \"category\": \"testing tool\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Drizz\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/drizz\",\n    \"description\": \"Mobile tests that write, run, and fix themselves autonomously for mobile app development workflows.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-19\",\n    \"category\": \"testing tool\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Haystack\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/haystack\",\n    \"description\": \"Review only the pull requests that actually need human attention with AI for code review workflows.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-19\",\n    \"category\": \"code review\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Shuffle Design CLI\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/shuffle-design-cli\",\n    \"description\": \"Multi-AI CLI for building and redesigning websites with frontend development automation.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-22\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Raindrop Workshop\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/raindrop-workshop\",\n    \"description\": \"Open-source, free, local debugger for AI agents to inspect and fix agent behavior.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-14\",\n    \"category\": \"debugging tool\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Emdash\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/emdash\",\n    \"description\": \"One app that manages every coding agent with open-source integration for unified agent control.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-20\",\n    \"category\": \"agent management\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\n      \"Running parallel agents on isolated worktrees is brilliant for testing features\",\n      \"SSH support makes remote development seamless\",\n      \"Finally a unified interface for all my coding agents\",\n      \"Open-source integrations are a huge plus\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Re_gent\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/re-gent\",\n    \"description\": \"Version Control for AI agent activity to track changes and enable rollbacks of agent actions.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-20\",\n    \"category\": \"agent infrastructure\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Polarity\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/polarity\",\n    \"description\": \"The Self-Improvement Stack for AI agents that enables agents to learn and improve over time.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-18\",\n    \"category\": \"agent infrastructure\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"InstaVM\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/instavm\",\n    \"description\": \"Instant computers for AI agents to run workflows and tasks in isolated environments.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-21\",\n    \"category\": \"agent infrastructure\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Asteroid Build\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/asteroid-build\",\n    \"description\": \"Build Browser, Linux and Windows AI agents in seconds with no-code agent builder for rapid deployment.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-14\",\n    \"category\": \"no-code agent builder\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Open Browser\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/open-browser\",\n    \"description\": \"Open-source browser automation for local AI agents to enable web-based workflows.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-14\",\n    \"category\": \"open-source tool\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  }\n]\n",
